Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.09,0:05:39.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Lily? From high school? Remember? - Oh, God, Lily. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.09,0:05:39.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-高中的莉莉  记得吗  -天哪  莉莉
